   "source": [
    "## Step 7 — Turn Probability into a DECISION\n",
    "\n",
    "**This is where analyst becomes credit strategist.** A model outputs a probability (e.g. 0.12). The business decision is: approve or decline? You pick a THRESHOLD.\n",
    "\n",
    "- Approve if P(default) < threshold.\n",
    "- Lower threshold = stricter = fewer approvals, less risk.\n",
    "- Higher threshold = looser = more approvals, more risk.\n",
    "\n",
    "This trade-off IS credit policy — Vojtech's daily job."
   ]
